# Build context for the production frontend image.
#
# `COPY . .` must never carry the developer's machine into the image: a host
# node_modules holds platform-specific binaries (esbuild/rollup), and copying it
# over the `npm ci` install breaks the Linux build. dist/ and the backup folder
# are stale artefacts; .env* would leak configuration into the layer cache.
node_modules/
dist/
tests/
nirvaah-brand-kit-v2/
.src-backup-*/
*.log
.env
.env.*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
